      ],
      "recognized": "stop",
      "actual": "stop"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-zh-07",
      "text": "刚才蓝老在跑，现在不要停下来。",
      "modelAction": "stop",
      "allowed": [
        null
      ],
      "recognized": null,
      "actual": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-zh-08",
      "text": "你能不能别跑，过来陪我？",
      "modelAction": "come",
      "allowed": [
        null,
        "stop"
      ],
      "recognized": "come",
      "actual": "come"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-zh-09",
      "text": "请停止自动续费。",
      "modelAction": "stop",
      "allowed": [
        null
      ],
      "recognized": null,
      "actual": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-zh-10",
      "text": "今天难过，蓝老，可以摇尾巴给我看吗？",
      "modelAction": "wag",
      "allowed": [
        "wag"
      ],
      "recognized": "wag",
      "actual": "wag"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-zh-11",
      "text": "你知道是谁让蓝老跑步的吗？",
      "modelAction": "run",
      "allowed": [
        null
      ],
      "recognized": null,
      "actual": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-zh-12",
      "text": "在我的故事里，蓝老听到跑步口令。",
      "modelAction": "run",
      "allowed": [
        null
      ],
      "recognized": null,
      "actual": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-en-01",
      "text": "Please stop the background music.",
      "modelAction": "stop",
      "allowed": [
        null
      ],
      "recognized": null,
      "actual": null
    },
    {
